{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "菅原咲月です🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サクサクヒムヒム ☆推しの降る夜☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "観てくれたかな〜〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobLvXT7V.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "コナンくんに会えたよ、、、\n夢みたいな写真です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小さい頃から、\n考えない日なんてないくらい！\n私の日常の、人生の一部だった作品！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こうして、お仕事させて頂けるなんて今だに夢のようだ〜、、、\n嬉しいね☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めて、写真みると\n自分がにやけすぎていて怖いです。笑\nマネージャーさんにも言われた気がする😯"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://tver.jp/episodes/epho6pv458"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "TVerでも配信してます！\nよろしくお願いします☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「劇場版名探偵コナン 時計じかけの摩天楼」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "劇場版一作目！！\n私のブログのタイトルの意味がわかります🫶🏻\n赤い糸、伝説、きゅんきゅん、、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好きなシーンが詰まっています。😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobds4bLZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}